<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia's Systematic stock suspended.</title>
<headline>Malaysia's Systematic stock suspended.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Systematic Education Group Bhd's stock was suspended on Tuesday at the company's request, an official at the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>Company officials were not available for comment. Shares of the firm, which runs education centres, closed at 12.90 ringgit on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
